# Redundant U-Boot environment in raw MMC — two copies in the gap before
# the first partition. Offsets must match CONFIG_ENV_OFFSET(_REDUND) in
# the U-Boot fragments and the uboot-env-a/b entries in genimage.cfg.
# libubootenv alternates writes and falls back to the valid copy, so an
# interrupted fw_setenv (RAUC) or saveenv (boot.scr) cannot lose the env.
# Device name    Device offset    Env. size
/dev/mmcblk0       0x400000         0x4000
/dev/mmcblk0       0x404000         0x4000
